window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Just when I thought things couldn't get more complicated at MistHallow Academy, my past and present collide in the worst way possible.</b></p> <p>My sire, the vampire who ruined my life but at the same time, gave me everything, has joined forces with the very Order that is trying to wipe me out. Their target is not just me, but the entire academy–my home, my haven, my friends, my loves.</p> <p>I'm still trying to balance my relationships with Caine, Thorne, and Flint. Each of them holds a piece of my heart, and now I realise they also hold the key to our survival.</p> <p>The Order of the Shadows Descent is closing in, and we're running out of options.</p> <p>With MistHallow under siege and the supernatural world on the brink of exposure, I'm forced to make impossible choices. Do I sacrifice the last of my humanity to save those I love?</p> <p>As the final battle looms, I'll have to trust in the strength of our love and the power of our unity. It all comes down to this. One night. One choice. One eternal bond.</p> <p>Welcome to the heart-pounding conclusion of the Shadows Descent Trilogy.</p> <p><i>This is a dark paranormal romance book three out of three in a reverse harem romance by </i>USA Today<i> bestselling author, Eve Newton. Set in England and written in British English. Contains mature content. A complete list of content warnings can be found on the author's website.</i></p>"; 
